      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s02-ee829c9ef24e.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "b80899c1235dc6e0290957e2534dbf72d8108ac3ccf24c9b9bd6ffe348de2cb0",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s02.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "d3108af13e996a1ceeb029135edf7c52fbb7e7d6566026fc8f53dc85cee2b8e2",
      "audio_start_sample": 259488,
      "audio_end_sample": 603936,
      "audio_start_seconds": 5.406,
      "audio_end_seconds": 12.582,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 162,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 5.4,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.005999999999999339,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "Two explanations can create the same apparent imbalance.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s03-2654139c78f3.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "fa7c96a33fef66543d4b4e13a6277acdc5213b4a9ddded5f6ea7c9adeed62106",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s03.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "660e5fff0b517fdd2bb8eb6b0d8ff7e667c129491388291aa0f45e91b32de048",
      "audio_start_sample": 719028,
      "audio_end_sample": 874548,
      "audio_start_seconds": 14.97975,
      "audio_end_seconds": 18.21975,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 449,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 14.966666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.013083333333332448,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "One places the pattern in the images.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s04-c2f6b0727d04.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "a51f4f39c98f59516809e51af52c14826d1c3d3b644814d0acfa241033f8860d",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s04.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "c6ef78667affb9d4fbf5b4c9a6e64a54b1acbbe9a67a7ba299c74392102dca4f",
      "audio_start_sample": 910548,
      "audio_end_sample": 1049940,
      "audio_start_seconds": 18.96975,
      "audio_end_seconds": 21.87375,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 569,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 18.966666666666665,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0030833333333362134,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "The other places it in the labeling process.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s05-798294462935.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "292b8bb6b5afa73828eb9fce6436870cc68023b9578d9efa5541b4c59170a785",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s05.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "516f651d41fd8f189e2b792d6e2538b04e72fe8bfd28f3eca2436722433b4629",
      "audio_start_sample": 1085940,
      "audio_end_sample": 1271412,
      "audio_start_seconds": 22.62375,
      "audio_end_seconds": 26.48775,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 679,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 22.633333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.009583333333331723,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "Apply one test to both: mirror a conceptual spiral horizontally.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s06-b5c4857269cd.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "cbbd1d01b8b0928380c57171a25814664a72419930de36176c3b3649a9c555b8",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s06.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "5296696a68f75aaf02a759da0e1ec477d91ee9de0628f688efab9529eacab88a",
      "audio_start_sample": 1386504,
      "audio_end_sample": 1588104,
      "audio_start_seconds": 28.8855,
      "audio_end_seconds": 33.0855,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 867,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 28.9,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.014499999999998181,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "The geometry reverses, and its apparent label inverts from clockwise to anticlockwise.",
      "word_count": 12,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s07-4ec7573b3247.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "05e832f70eff947c36e760a27a2c4af847f33360a3029ab852c51fc8dddbd78e",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s07.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "32b95de4e2c581984b6a7cf2107cd94f427014cf345cc4d33301c396dcf65407",
      "audio_start_sample": 1624104,
      "audio_end_sample": 1901736,
      "audio_start_seconds": 33.8355,
      "audio_end_seconds": 39.6195,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1015,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 33.833333333333336,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0021666666666675383,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "An image-linked pattern must follow that inversion.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s08-4cf8c4870f16.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "eebbe2e5cd40eb09658ba14a27fc774aebdad9a47b012dee36f8858272805c7e",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s08.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "494ca6d6a4f726e2a21ce3278d73f88e3d278a5cc0516441c06ee7a68f49496a",
      "audio_start_sample": 1937736,
      "audio_end_sample": 2115144,
      "audio_start_seconds": 40.3695,
      "audio_end_seconds": 44.0655,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1211,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 40.36666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0028333333333350197,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "A labeling-process effect need not follow the pixels.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s09-d859570abc59.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "a2a769ac92f0058dc88b7178b4d27e5812c0726af4759511fdbf24644b51336e",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s09.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "01f1567f28b246ed51cda7652accf7313788a6952e21b3080b0cfbd2b27563e9",
      "audio_start_sample": 2151144,
      "audio_end_sample": 2335464,
      "audio_start_seconds": 44.8155,
      "audio_end_seconds": 48.6555,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1344,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 44.8,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.015500000000002956,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "One mirror, two predicted behaviors: that is the discriminant.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s10-3c444532869a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "aaa8272a83e8a7b2c55cc14b467c2f49133c440807f37a1a32fa4472a5bfdddb",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s10.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "e116755dd446d7d654c7ac6d81cf06dcf5cab3dac9fef83fdcf8651d68ce2312",
      "audio_start_sample": 2371464,
      "audio_end_sample": 2529288,
      "audio_start_seconds": 49.4055,
      "audio_end_seconds": 52.6935,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1482,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 49.4,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.005500000000004945,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "Before any number was computed, we fixed the mirror logic, every cut, both thresholds, and paired comparisons.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s11-1d072584576a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "5368f9068ebc45743dea61f249d68df7c629924ed6df5bf9253343d6c3cff453",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s11.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "4bb6f06df7d5570553d856122a7e042bdaf282a40c1b9c4eaec51e8b7d93c9cb",
      "audio_start_sample": 2644380,
      "audio_end_sample": 2951964,
      "audio_start_seconds": 55.09125,
      "audio_end_seconds": 61.49925,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1653,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 55.1,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.008749999999999147,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "The frozen Galaxy Zoo 1 source contains 667,944 rows.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s12-390ca91eca91.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "b875583832fab1724e8e6d19fcea6d7eaaaafaa0676ccacdc1dd500a19f11419",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s12.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "b63020c7b2d85c1528e9eab9dee0df12fc856fb7364e1b83935c6fc32b80ff83",
      "audio_start_sample": 3067056,
      "audio_end_sample": 3381552,
      "audio_start_seconds": 63.897,
      "audio_end_seconds": 70.449,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1917,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 63.9,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.0030000000000001137,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "Three parallel readouts apply the spiral flag and two frozen thresholds; exact counts stay attached to their branches.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s13-1a27c2ca9817.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "75ada2e413acfc9a206407ca494146eb795a3a654e1adfcfbb524c7a317c46ea",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s13.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "a4ae790bcbd5652ea6a633d80355da1d67e7d009eebdaabec0b22d3ef9eef4b2",
      "audio_start_sample": 3417552,
      "audio_end_sample": 3741264,
      "audio_start_seconds": 71.199,
      "audio_end_seconds": 77.943,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2136,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 71.2,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.0010000000000047748,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Within one readout, N C W and N A C W count the labels.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s14-fedecb328ae8.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "ab6dbd0ab011a7ddb78d800ab554a7d30d70fb2ed622b537b26d7989e360a3b3",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s14.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "970a3979316dae2d96090ccee7b589bfd8d6626425f9129619be5cf6440b4d13",
      "audio_start_sample": 3856356,
      "audio_end_sample": 4101732,
      "audio_start_seconds": 80.34075,
      "audio_end_seconds": 85.45275,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2410,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 80.33333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.00741666666667129,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Their difference is the numerator, and their total is the denominator.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s15-b20390383d0f.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "ec9e18eff580418715975c2eeb74872ed1058e76fe6a4c7afbfd44e1487f82f9",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s15.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "efedc8a2ca9769fc267e91a0a1f3561343841d2351ae43b514144b3455f849ab",
      "audio_start_sample": 4137732,
      "audio_end_sample": 4323204,
      "audio_start_seconds": 86.20275,
      "audio_end_seconds": 90.06675,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2586,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 86.2,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0027499999999918145,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "The sign would indicate which label is more numerous, but the predeclared asymmetry value remains withheld.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s16-57707812688a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "f46de63c0438d5c47c664736b38a19920a9a418234bc4cceba43a96db4bebb57",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s16.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "b3b1fb58fcd334af2153d090836a9d8d116a8d246c4cced47264e3025c38a271",
      "audio_start_sample": 4359204,
      "audio_end_sample": 4637988,
      "audio_start_seconds": 90.81675,
      "audio_end_seconds": 96.62475,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2725,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 90.83333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.01658333333332962,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "The control matrix joins the mirror, both thresholds, and same-object pairs.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s17-3d9085cd8f35.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "17464730d5dcdc3d1107fc984fe7adaba81f93843557eb2d4a14740fdca176ae",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s17.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "36f5ee44e829e7d51bebb69905df641fcd8695d1530b500781bef36206d1946c",
      "audio_start_sample": 4753080,
      "audio_end_sample": 4981176,
      "audio_start_seconds": 99.0225,
      "audio_end_seconds": 103.7745,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2971,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 99.03333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.010833333333337691,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "They test inversion, threshold sensitivity, and individual change versus sample composition; design only.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s18-4d1afd6be2a8.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "e9525bd88e64e0c2b3dd4dac742d27190678e273e0bc6aae2c1b3cb6714df1f8",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s18.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "729a4265a3568c22e4c2ce503ff774035ba85e8fe48366ecbd2a444652c94bf2",
      "audio_start_sample": 5017176,
      "audio_end_sample": 5351256,
      "audio_start_seconds": 104.5245,
      "audio_end_seconds": 111.4845,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3136,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 104.53333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.008833333333328142,
      "pause_after_samples": 115092,
      "pause_after_seconds": 2.39775
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "discipline-gates",
      "text": "We tied our own hands so the answer cannot be shaped by choices made after seeing it.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s19-b62c1d547b78.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "55c096730386720e1370459b79d812b3c983a472b663446596d7527f4a78de4a",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v2/decoded/s19.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "f27a3d8ddceabd0a33e9cc16b7388677aff9827226b5bb0712ebb706b10faa5d",
      "audio_start_sample": 5466348,
      "audio_end_sample": 5711724,
      "audio_start_seconds": 113.88225,
      "audio_end_seconds": 118.99425,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3416,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 113.86666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.015583333333339056,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "section": "discipline-gates",
      "text": "That standard makes the independent post-run verdict the next gate; the stored-direction frame and evidence, receipt, and referee checks must also meet the frozen rules.",
      "word_count": 25,
      "raw_file": "audio_v2/raw/s20-b1363e4835be.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "d83414423d1c10d2cf61fc952a233f41ca95560344cdc2385aca9437bcb5b58f",
